<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>He spoke words that I’d never heard,</l><l>Yet how He did stir up my thirst!</l><l>He spoke of the water that lives,</l><l>To all who are thirsty, He freely will give.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Now this living water have I!</l><l>I drink and I soar to the sky!</l><l>His praises now fill all the air</l><l>Because I am speaking Him, now, everywhere!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
